## 2. Check Prime Number

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int n = 13;
        boolean prime = true;

        for(int i=2;i<=n/2;i++) {
            if(n%i==0) {
                prime=false;
                break;
            }
        }

        if(prime)
            System.out.println("Prime");
        else
            System.out.println("Not Prime");
    }
}
```

### Output

```
Prime
```

