## 5. Reverse Number

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int n=1234,rev=0;

        while(n!=0){
            rev=rev*10+n%10;
            n=n/10;
        }

        System.out.println(rev);
    }
}
```

### Output

```
4321
```

