## 6. Palindrome Number

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int num=121,temp=num,rev=0;

        while(num!=0){
            rev=rev*10+num%10;
            num/=10;
        }

        if(temp==rev)
            System.out.println("Palindrome");
        else
            System.out.println("Not Palindrome");
    }
}
```

### Output

```
Palindrome
```

