## 7. Armstrong Number

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int num=153,temp=num,sum=0;

        while(num!=0){
            int rem=num%10;
            sum+=rem*rem*rem;
            num/=10;
        }

        if(temp==sum)
            System.out.println("Armstrong");
    }
}
```

### Output

```
Armstrong
```

