## 9. Check Palindrome String

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str="madam";
        String rev="";

        for(int i=str.length()-1;i>=0;i--)
            rev+=str.charAt(i);

        if(str.equals(rev))
            System.out.println("Palindrome");
    }
}
```

### Output

```
Palindrome
```

