## 10. Count Vowels

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str="education";
        int count=0;

        for(char c:str.toCharArray()) {
            if("aeiou".indexOf(c)!=-1)
                count++;
        }

        System.out.println(count);
    }
}
```

### Output

```
5
```

