## 20. Stream API

```java
import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        List<Integer> list =
                Arrays.asList(10,20,30,40);

        list.stream()
            .filter(x->x>20)
            .forEach(System.out::println);
    }
}
```

### Output

```
30
40
```
